  "notes": [
    "G05.3 is an offline audit of the existing RegionTravel.rb Ruby code. No native NPC, event, source map, arrival point or installation is added.",
    "Runtime transport requires a physical regional agent in the initial town, a safe Essentials scene, a genuine merged source and installed safe arrival destination.",
