    "Unova is included in circuit but not in RegionTravel.destination source/destination allowlist; claiming Unova native travel is forbidden despite symbolic progress.",
    "All installation and map points in fixtures are labels and explicitly synthetic, not a claim that Kanto, Johto or Hoenn is installed in a player's copy.",
